\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Short paragraph (use for quick context):\
NGN (Neguinho Motors Ltd) is a London motorcycle business selling new and used Honda & Yamaha bikes, offering longer-term rentals (minimum 6 weeks; tax, MOT and weekly maintenance included), servicing (basic and major), motorcycle MOTs, repairs, nationwide delivery, accessory sales and accident-management support. Contact branches: Catford (0208 314 1498), Tooting (0203 409 5478), Sutton (0208 412 9275). Customer-service phone hours: Mon\'96Sat 09:00\'9618:00. NGN Club members get 10% off purchases and loyalty credits (10% credit per \'a31 on repairs/accessories/MOT; 2% per \'a31 on bike purchases). Credits post after 48 hours and expire after six months. Prices and stock rotate on the site; always confirm product page for final quotes.\
Longer background (use for knowledge panel / longer context):\
Neguinho Motors Ltd (trading as NGN) is registered in London (company no. 11600635, 9\'9613 Catford Hill, SE6 4NU). The business focuses on commuter and urban motorcycles and scooters \'97 Honda and Yamaha models predominate in their new-stock highlights \'97 and runs a multi-week rental fleet that covers popular 125cc commuter scooters (Vision, Forza, PCX, SH, Yamaha NMAX/XMAX). Rentals are shown as \'93from\'94 weekly prices (examples: Honda Vision \'a370/wk, many models at \'a375/wk) with a minimum hire of six weeks; all hires include tax, MOT and weekly maintenance.\
Services include basic servicing (recommended approximately every 6,000 miles), full/major servicing (~12,000 miles), MOT testing by qualified testers, fault diagnosis and general mechanical and electrical repairs. The business offers nationwide vehicle transport within England (site lists a flat example price of \'a3249.99) and offers free collection if you book repairs. The online shop stocks helmets, jackets, boots, gloves, luggage, security products and spares with tracked delivery.\
NGN runs the NGN Club loyalty scheme: members receive 10% discount on purchases and accrue credits \'97 10% credit per \'a31 spent on repairs/maintenance/accessories/MOT, and 2% credit per \'a31 spent on motorbike purchases. Credits are non-transferable, one account per person, do not apply to purchases made before joining, become available 48 hours after qualifying purchases and expire after 6 months. Members must agree to the club terms and data is processed under GDPR / Data Protection Act 2018. The site reserves rights to change club terms.\
Operational contact: primary branch Catford 0208 314 1498; site lists Tooting and Sutton branches with phones. Customer service phone hours are shown as Mon\'96Sat 09:00\'9618:00; for branch visits call ahead. Because the site uses rotating carousels and \'93prices start from\'94 phrases, the bot should present prices as \'93from \'a3X\'94 and when asked for a final quote either link to the live product page or offer to call the branch.\
